<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 370 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 370 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 370 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>The Bank said 160 million stg was allotted in bills outright maturing on or before March 19 and 210 million stg comprised repos to March 18 and 19.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
